      "problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14218586/assets/b8150a85386a2ebea9119820d25f227a6cb33aef8dd09b519feef4e8f70a4013.png)\n\nThe graph of $y=f(x)$ is shown above. Which of the following is the graph of $y=2f(x)?$\n\n(*Note: Figures not drawn to scale*)",
